<title>HONG KONG: Major shareholder cut stake in Theme.</title>
<headline>Major shareholder cut stake in Theme.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Theme International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday one of its major shareholders, Chiu Ka Lun, had reduced his stake in the company by 10 million shares, or 2.04 percent of the company's issued share capital.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Chiu held 96.75 million shares, or 19.75 percent of Theme International, as at September 13.</p>
<p>Shares of the fashion retailer were unchanged at HK$2.70 at midday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
